    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our journey</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035880/extras/a680c3025ccee41c01f4aa11dcc98074.avif?t=1755212182\" width=600 height=226 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035880/extras/2cd5526689449dce9626b40efd5e7d74.avif?t=1755212182\" data-has-big width=800 height=371 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the boundaries of your neighborhood, an unknown world awaits you and your trusty buddy. With boots on your feet, an umbrella in your hand, and an innate thirst for exploration, that\u2019s all you need to embark on this adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035880/extras/77a1953380275adc246a89f03a602782.avif?t=1755212182\" data-has-big width=800 height=408 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a cute-but-creepy aesthetic, Devil\u2019s Drizzle is a 2D platforming adventure narrated through the eyes of an innocent child. Face your nightmares, conquer the darkness, fight furballs, and confront ancient Sumerian demons in these uncharted lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035880/extras/9a17ac57b3ce877dfcefbc8ceb862c2a.avif?t=1755212182\" data-has-big width=800 height=425 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic platforming mechanics with modern enhancements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight controls. Jump, dash, and blast enemies as you navigate mysterious settings.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic lighting. Uncover hidden secrets in the dark using the lightnings of a mythical amulet!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art graphics. Relive the charm of classic games with beautifully crafted pixel art!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique landscapes. Explore distant forests, delve into the guts of a Sumerian demon, and confront your fears in the dream world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic levels with unique mechanics. Soar through the skies, free-fall to escape Pazuzu, and challenge enemies with puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss battles. Face the Giant Furball of Death, battle the Evil Umbrella, and take down the fearsome Pazuzu!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex dialogue and story. Tackle insecurities, reflect on your existence, and uncover the true meaning of friendship!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings. Finish the story to unveil each of the three possible endings!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035880/extras/79da5d6526b63d45f6ecbd68257206ba.avif?t=1755212182\" data-has-big width=800 height=371 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A handcrafted story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <i>Devil\u2019s Drizzle</i> comes to life through the work of talented creators, with hand-drawn 2D illustrations and animations. Each new area you explore has its own unique flair, brimming with new mechanics, enemies, and meaningful details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join this adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re a fan of classic games, a cute-but-creepy aesthetic, narratives full of twists, and impactful endings,<i> Devil\u2019s Drizzle </i>is the perfect choice for your next adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035880/extras/faedccd5e874207cd7e1f81e889fd55e.avif?t=1755212182\" data-has-big width=800 height=631 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035880/extras/2cd5526689449dce9626b40efd5e7d74.avif?t=1755212182\" data-has-big width=800 height=371 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the boundaries of your neighborhood, an unknown world awaits you and your trusty buddy. With boots on your feet, an umbrella in your hand, and an innate thirst for exploration, that\u2019s all you need to embark on this adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035880/extras/77a1953380275adc246a89f03a602782.avif?t=1755212182\" data-has-big width=800 height=408 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a cute-but-creepy aesthetic, Devil\u2019s Drizzle is a 2D platforming adventure narrated through the eyes of an innocent child. Face your nightmares, conquer the darkness, fight furballs, and confront ancient Sumerian demons in these uncharted lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035880/extras/9a17ac57b3ce877dfcefbc8ceb862c2a.avif?t=1755212182\" data-has-big width=800 height=425 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic platforming mechanics with modern enhancements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight controls. Jump, dash, and blast enemies as you navigate mysterious settings.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic lighting. Uncover hidden secrets in the dark using the lightnings of a mythical amulet!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art graphics. Relive the charm of classic games with beautifully crafted pixel art!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique landscapes. Explore distant forests, delve into the guts of a Sumerian demon, and confront your fears in the dream world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic levels with unique mechanics. Soar through the skies, free-fall to escape Pazuzu, and challenge enemies with puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss battles. Face the Giant Furball of Death, battle the Evil Umbrella, and take down the fearsome Pazuzu!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex dialogue and story. Tackle insecurities, reflect on your existence, and uncover the true meaning of friendship!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings. Finish the story to unveil each of the three possible endings!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035880/extras/79da5d6526b63d45f6ecbd68257206ba.avif?t=1755212182\" data-has-big width=800 height=371 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A handcrafted story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <i>Devil\u2019s Drizzle</i> comes to life through the work of talented creators, with hand-drawn 2D illustrations and animations. Each new area you explore has its own unique flair, brimming with new mechanics, enemies, and meaningful details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join this adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re a fan of classic games, a cute-but-creepy aesthetic, narratives full of twists, and impactful endings,<i> Devil\u2019s Drizzle </i>is the perfect choice for your next adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035880/extras/faedccd5e874207cd7e1f81e889fd55e.avif?t=1755212182\" data-has-big width=800 height=631 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Devil's Drizzle is a 2D platformer that narrates the story of a kid in pursuit of his friend, an umbrella. Brave the storm and outrun the clutches of the demonic Pazuzu in this audacious effort to save your buddy.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cA game with Super Nintendo-style pixel art and Crash Bandicoot-style humor [...] Devil's Drizzle is a journey about companionship, imagination, and the fear of loneliness [...] It's in this blend of humor and more serious themes that the platformer indie game seeks to stand out \u2014 delivering a journey that engages players without losing sight of fun. The Brazilian game's own sarcasm draws references from children's animations filled with humor and social critique, like Adventure Time.\u201d<br>IGN Brasil<br><br>\u201cThis title offers an experience similar to Little Nightmares, where the player is captivated by the protagonist\u2019s innocence while simultaneously immersed in a dark and unsettling atmosphere. With the central theme of \u201cfear of loneliness,\u201d the game presents moments where the player will face difficult and impactful choices.\u201d<br>Gamer<br><br>\u201cSICK looking upcoming games! | BEST NEW Indie Game Trailers March 2025\u201d<br>Best Indie Games<br>",
